---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Field reporting dashboard | JayTech9"
  description="Replacing daily WhatsApp reports from branch field officers with a live dashboard that managers can filter by branch and date."
  ogType="article"
>
  <article>
    <header class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="crumb">
          <a href="/products/">Products</a>
        </p>
        <h1>Field reporting dashboard</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Replacing daily WhatsApp reports from branch field officers with a live dashboard that managers can
          filter by branch and date.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="wrap overlap">
        <dl class="facts facts-card">
          <div>
            <dt>Client</dt>
            <dd>A susu and microfinance platform</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Status</dt>
            <dd>
              <span class="status" data-status="In progress">
                In progress
              </span>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Year</dt>
            <dd>2026</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Built with</dt>
            <dd>PHP, MySQL</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap section case-body">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2 id="the-problem">The problem</h2>
        <p>
          Field officers across several branches send their daily collections as WhatsApp messages. Managers
          then add the figures up by hand, and errors and late reports are hard to spot.
        </p>
        <h2 id="what-were-building">What we’re building</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>One form per officer</strong> that saves collections straight to the database.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>A manager dashboard</strong> showing collections by branch, officer and day, with targets
            and shortfalls highlighted.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Role-based access</strong>, so officers, branch managers and head office each see the
            right level of detail.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 id="where-it-stands">Where it stands</h2>
        <p>The requirements and system structure are agreed, and the build is under way.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <nav class="wrap next" aria-label="Next project">
    <p class="muted">Next project</p>
    <a href="/products/agency-website-crm/">Website and CRM</a>
  </nav>
  <CtaBand
    heading="Tell us what slows your business down"
    text="Start with a free 30-minute call. We’ll listen, suggest what would help, and send a written quote with a clear timeline."
  />
</Base>

<style>
  .crumb {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .page-head h1 {
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .facts {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 8.5rem), 1fr));
    gap: 1rem 2rem;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
  }
  .facts dt {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .facts dd {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .facts .status {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
  .case-body {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }
  .next {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-section);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }
  .next a {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .next a:hover {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
